#: app/Modules/MCP/AbilitiesRegistrar.php:599
msgid ""
"Deliver a REAL test copy of a saved campaign or inline draft to to_email "
"(subject prefixed \"TEST:\"). Always sends an external email — for a no-send"
" render use render-email-preview instead. Does not enroll the recipient, "
"create a campaign record, or log to email_history. Accepts the same "
"sender/footer params as send-email-to-contact so the test matches the live "
"send."
msgstr ""
"Deliver a REAL test copy of a saved campaign or inline draft to to_email "
"(subject prefixed \"TEST:\"). Always sends an external email — for a no-send"
" render use render-email-preview instead. Does not enroll the recipient, "
"create a campaign record, or log to email_history. Accepts the same "
"sender/footer params as send-email-to-contact so the test matches the live "
"send."

#: app/Modules/MCP/AbilitiesRegistrar.php:630
msgid "Send Email to Contact"
msgstr "Send Email to Contact"

#: app/Modules/MCP/AbilitiesRegistrar.php:631
msgid ""
"Send a one-off email to a subscribed/transactional contact. Routes through "
"normal queue + bounce + FluentSMTP. SmartCodes resolve. Persists a "
"custom_email_campaign record (hidden from list-campaigns by default)."
msgstr ""
"Send a one-off email to a subscribed/transactional contact. Routes through "
"normal queue + bounce + FluentSMTP. SmartCodes resolve. Persists a "
"custom_email_campaign record (hidden from list-campaigns by default)."

#: app/Modules/MCP/AbilitiesRegistrar.php:701
msgid "Create or Update Campaign"
msgstr "Create or Update Campaign"

#: app/Modules/MCP/AbilitiesRegistrar.php:702
msgid ""
"Create or update a draft campaign. Never sends — use change-campaign-status "
"to schedule. recipients persists tags + lists ONLY (no statuses/contact_type"
" — apply a temp tag first). Returns estimated_recipients + warnings inline."
msgstr ""
"Create or update a draft campaign. Never sends — use change-campaign-status "
"to schedule. recipients persists tags + lists ONLY (no statuses/contact_type"
" — apply a temp tag first). Returns estimated_recipients + warnings inline."

#: app/Modules/MCP/AbilitiesRegistrar.php:801
msgid "Change Campaign Status"
msgstr "Change Campaign Status"

#: app/Modules/MCP/AbilitiesRegistrar.php:802
msgid ""
"State transition. schedule + delete are destructive. pause/resume only valid"
" mid-send (working↔paused). unschedule reverts to draft and clears "
"scheduled_at."
msgstr ""
"State transition. schedule + delete are destructive. pause/resume only valid"
" mid-send (working↔paused). unschedule reverts to draft and clears "
"scheduled_at."

#: app/Modules/MCP/AbilitiesRegistrar.php:823
msgid "Update Contact Automation Status"
msgstr "Update Contact Automation Status"

#: app/Modules/MCP/AbilitiesRegistrar.php:824
msgid ""
"Resume, cancel, or advance_now a contact in a funnel. cancel is destructive "
"(reversible in UI but halts processing). advance_now requires "
"advance_to_sequence_id and skips intermediate benchmarks."
msgstr ""
"Resume, cancel, or advance_now a contact in a funnel. cancel is destructive "
"(reversible in UI but halts processing). advance_now requires "
"advance_to_sequence_id and skips intermediate benchmarks."

